# DESK18 conf probe: open Options -> "Desktop configuration...", take one
# picture and let method/desk18_patch.py dump the dialog's absolute
# rectangles; then Cancel out.
#   Options title centre (196, 8) and the drop-down entry pitch are DESK05's:
#   box at x=160, entry n at y = 27 + 16n. "Desktop configuration..." is
#   entry 7 -> (200, 139).
100 parkbr
300 move 600 460
1000 arm
1200 mark P_IDLE
1500 move 196 8
2200 mark Q_OPTIONS
2500 move 200 139
2700 down
2703 up
2900 move 600 460
4200 mark R_CONF
